From: John Murray <5672686+JRMurr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 11:21:18 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] SHARE_CONFIG: apps in the desktop keep the user's config

session/config_links.py links ~/.config and ~/.local/state into the desktop's
own folders, except Plasma's and KWin's files.
